Source: postbis
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/no0p/postbis

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-postbis
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-postbis
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Biological sequence data types and functions for PostgreSQL
 PostBIS provides compact DNA, RNA, amino-acid, and aligned biological
 sequence types, together with type modifiers, sequence functions,
 comparison operators, and btree and hash operator classes.
